      answer: "c", explanation: "Pleurotus ostreatus is oyster mushroom. Golden oyster refers to Pleurotus citrinopileatus, whereas horse mushroom, rice-straw mushroom and shiitake are the separate species listed elsewhere in the table.", sectionId: "agaricus-body-and-food-examples", source: { document: "biology", page: 238 }, cognitive: "recall"
